  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mid Term review of the African Technology and Innovation and the Strengthening Research institution in Africa Programmes.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to provide a deeper understanding of the quality and progress of implementation, assess effectiveness of the each of the Programme mechanisms and interventions, determine the individual project&#x2019;s contribution to achieving the ATIP and SRIA programme outcomes and provide a programme level evaluation of these contributions towards ATIP and SRIA desired impact, and UK overarching development objectives</narrative>
  </description>
